<html>
	<body>
<pre class='c'><code>; Single line <span class='kw'>comment
section .data</span>
    msg <span class='kw'>db</span> <span class='str'>'Hello, World!'</span>, 0
<span class='kw'>section</span> .text
    <span class='kw'>global</span> _start
_start:
    <span class='kw'>mov eax</span>, 4
    <span class='kw'>mov ebx</span>, 1
    <span class='kw'>mov ecx</span>, msg
    <span class='kw'>mov edx</span>, 13
    <span class='kw'>int</span> 0x80</code></pre>
	</body>
</html>